\label{tab:severity_comparison}
\begin{tabular}{llll}
\toprule
Claim & Moderate+ & Any-violation & Concordance \\
\midrule
C1 $\Delta$ & 34.0 pp & 38.2 pp & Both $p < 10^{-50}$ \\
