\midrule
Cond.\ prec. & $0.251$ & 0.202 & $1.24$ & $0.215$ \\
Coreferential & $0.528$ & 0.244 & $2.17$ & $0.030$ \\
Incompleteness & $0.379$ & 0.161 & $2.36$ & $0.018$ \\
Lexical & $0.336$ & 0.176 & $1.91$ & $0.056$ \\
